# Vercel preview push metering

- Each push to **`preview`** can start **about three** Vercel preview deployments.
- Batch changes into **fewer commits**; avoid push-per-commit loops.
- **Do not push** until the work is ready for preview verification, or the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer local commits and state what is ready to push; confirm before pushing when unclear.
- After each **`preview`** push, check Vercel preview deployments for this repo; when status is **Ready**, merge **`preview`** into **`main`** and push **`main`** (see `AGENTS.md`).
- Follow branch rules in `AGENTS.md` (`preview` / named `feature/*`; not `main` unless requested).
